            {
                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2610.36729/2610.36729v1/teaser.png",
                "caption": "Figure 1:Interactive world generation with  Hy-Nomas.Free-form text instructions and continuous camera control can be interleaved across successive interaction turns. At each turn, a vision-language Prompt Enhancer converts the user request and observed world history into a structured text prompt and a duration for the next video segment. Conditioned on these inputs and cached context,  Hy-Nomas autoregressively generates the next segment, allowing the world to unfold through continued interaction.",
                "position": 327
            }
        ]
