                "caption": "Figure 12:Qualitative comparison of multi-turn text interaction.In the first example,  Hy-Nomas clearly shows\nthe apple being grasped, lifted, and brought to the plate.\nLingBot-World v2 changes the apple’s color and gripper structure, while\nHappyOyster-Directing shows discontinuous views without a clear\ngrasp-and-lift progression.\nIn the second example,  Hy-Nomas visualizes the requested spatula, cutting on\nthe board, and strawberries in the glass bowl. LingBot-World v2 only shows\ncutting strawberries and a knife without spatula, while\nHappyOyster-Directing does not move strawberries into the bowl.",
